      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Greg and Viktor,\n\nI illustrated our hook purpose and relevant hook handle on code, please have a look.\n\nThe reason why we these hooks:\n1.Our code flow needs these hooks to fix some issues when in sd situation:\na.sdr104 compatible issue.\nb.bad card issue.\nc.fast power off function.\n\n2.Our sd card factory test needs the irq count in mmc_gpio_cd_irqt.\n\nThe reason why we can\u0027t sent these code upstream directly:\n1.Since we only use sd card in our situation, we can\u0027t ensure the code stability in mmc card situation.\n2.The hook handle is to fix sd card issues that we encountered and to meet some factory test requirement, so the code may not suitable to all the genetic usage.\n\nThanks.",
      "revId": "a085c64ba89494355af05235676cd63d9ed1ba84",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
