      "side": 1,
      "message": "/* mmc_blk_mq_rw_recovery hook handle\n * 1.mark MMC_BAD_CARD flag, which will be used in sdhci_get_cd(mmc/host/sdhci.c) and be cleared in mmc_gpio_cd_irqt.(mmc/core/slot-gpio.c).\n * 2.set card status MMC_CARD_REMOVED.\n * 3.schedule mmc_rescan.\n */\nstatic void vmmc_blk_mq_rw_recovery(void *data, struct mmc_card *card)\n{\n\tif (mmc_card_sd(card) \u0026\u0026 (!mmc_card_removed(card))) {\n\t\tpr_err(\"%s: %d: %s removing bad card\\n\",\n\t\t       __func__, __LINE__, mmc_hostname(card-\u003ehost));\n\t\tcard-\u003ehost-\u003eandroid_oem_data1 |\u003d MMC_BAD_CARD;\n\t\tmmc_card_set_removed(card);\n\t\tmmc_detect_change(card-\u003ehost, msecs_to_jiffies(1000));\n\t}\n}",
